flowchart TD
    subgraph Interview[Interview: state lives for one invoke]
        Input[Controller constructs input] --> State[InterviewState Annotation]
        State --> Node1[Node reads selected fields]
        Node1 --> Update[Node returns partial state update]
        Update --> Route{Conditional router}
        Route --> Node2[Next node reads shared invocation state]
        Node2 --> Output[Graph returns result]
        Output --> Persist[Controller writes interview MongoDB document]
        Persist -. new HTTP request reloads document .-> Input
    end
    subgraph Roadmap[Roadmap: one graph invocation]
        RInput[Controller request fields] --> RState[roadmapState Annotation]
        RState --> RNode[Roadmap agent updates roadmap]
        RNode --> Resource[Resource agent enriches modules]
        Resource --> ROutput[Graph result]
        ROutput --> RDB[Controller persists MongoDB]
        RDB --> Cache[Redis retrieval cache]
    end
    NoCheckpoint[No checkpointer or thread persistence configured]
